      "original_id": "",
      "message": "I can't answer the policy minimum weighted score from this room — `bid-policy` is not here, and I don't open or cite it. Nothing in `rfp-northstar` or `capability-snapshot` states a score threshold, so as far as the supplied material goes it's not found in supplied material. The Bid Critic applies that policy.\n\nMinimum margin: `capability-snapshot` §6 records a **15% target margin, marked “policy minimum”**, and §5 says Helix drops the margin from 18% to 11%, below that 15%. That's the snapshot quoting policy, not me applying it — the actual margin check is the Critic's call.",
